<p>Sends out a surge of undeath energies into your aura.</p><p>All minions inside gain 25% speed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns</p><p>All non-ghoul minions are healed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 15%, 17%, 20%, 22%.</acronym></p><p>If you know Call of the Mausoleum, the time remaining to the next free ghoul is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5.</acronym></p><p>if you know Corpse Explosion or Putrescent Liquefaction the duration of those effects are increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5.</acronym></p><p>All non-undead foes caught inside are dazed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 6, 7, 8, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>In addition all your minions (created after you learn this spell) have a passive health regeneration.</p>